# K4510x, the package list.  Three groups: what the machine needs to run,
# what it needs to be REBUILT (the point of this distribution), and what the
# hardware needs to come up at all.

# --- the machine ---
libsdl2-2.0-0
alsa-utils

# --- the toolchain, installed by default (Doc, 2026-09-02) ---
# K4510x is the hosted build with the desktop taken away and the compilers
# kept.  cc65 builds the ROM; 64tass rebuilds Forth; nasm the Tube; FPC is
# what rebuilds Mad Pascal's mp (pascal/README.md).
build-essential
libsdl2-dev
cc65
acme
64tass
nasm
fp-compiler
python3
git
make
unzip

# --- somewhere to work ---
vim
less
ca-certificates

# --- the hardware ---
# KMSDRM is the ONLY video path here, so the GPU firmware is not optional:
# without it there is no KMS, and that appears as a black screen and an SDL
# failure rather than as anything naming a driver.  amd64 covers the t520's
# Radeon; the intel and misc blobs are there for whatever else this lands on.
firmware-amd-graphics
firmware-misc-nonfree
firmware-linux-free

# --- installing to the internal flash ---
debian-installer-launcher
